@startuml STM-4_TopUp
!include _style.iuml
title STM-4 TopUp (Charging Credit top-up)\ntop_ups.status · v0.3 · 24/10/2026 · confirmed by Khang
[*] --> pending : driver confirms amount\n[50,000–2,000,000 VND, balance after ≤ 5,000,000,\nno other open top-up for this account]\n/ create payment, expires in 15 min
pending --> credited : payment success (IPN or gateway query)\n[signature valid, amount matches, not yet applied]\n/ add full amount, settle shortfall,\nredeem points, request e-invoice
pending --> failed : payment failed\nor driver cancels
pending --> expired : 15 min without result\n[gateway query: not paid]
expired --> credited : late payment success\n[within 1 h of expiry, not yet applied]\n/ credit once
credited --> refunded : Admin refunds top-up (UC-ADM-08)\n[balance ≥ top-up amount, full refund,\nto original source]\n/ refund entry, restore points,\ninvoice adjustment
refunded --> [*]
credited --> [*]
failed --> [*]
expired --> [*] : late window (1 h) ends
note right of pending
  A repeated result never changes the state (BR-P13).
end note
note bottom of expired
  Success IPN after the late window: stored as a late
  payment (no credit, no invoice), acknowledged,
  listed for Admin refund (UC-ADM-08).
end note
@enduml
